  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.Neo4j.Driver.OASIS v1.0.0\n\nOASIS-pinned build of the Neo4j .NET driver (strong-named compatibility build) used by the OASIS Neo4j provider.\n\nWhat's new for this initial public release\n- docs: certify committed Neo4j CQL regression and refresh current guides (a685231)\n- fix: interrupt owned Neo4j CQL reads during cold handshakes (ddf933a)\n- fix: own Neo4j connection cancellation and preserve signed identity (4ed7439)\n- Neo4j.Driver.OASIS: add the NuGet metadata the release validator requires (8b524cf)\n- Neo4j.Driver.OASIS: use a plain X.Y.Z package version, which the release plan requires (the -oasis.1 build identity stays in InformationalVersion) (45afd08)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/Neo4j.Driver.OASIS",
